Subject: [PATCH] 9618: Clarify the six p-code branch forms in the SLEIGH
 documentation

Name all six forms and spell out that CBRANCH is the conditional branch. BRANCHIND appearing twice is intentional: CALLIND and RETURN are both indirect.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
